  ('vocab-import-c8fb554a62152a51a3179261', 'planet', 'ˈplænət', 'Hành tinh.', '(astronomy) any of the nine large celestial bodies in the solar system that revolve around the sun and shine by reflected light; Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune, and Pluto in order of their proximity to the sun; viewed from the constellation Hercules, all the planets rotate around the sun in a counterclockwise direction', 'noun', 'Jupiter is the largest planet in our solar system and orbits the sun.', 'Nghĩa trong ngữ cảnh: Hành tinh.', 'Science', 'B1', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], NULL),
