  ('vocab-import-b02b5038c335950b985f9fee', 'gender', 'ˈʤɛndər', 'Giới tính.', 'a grammatical category in inflected languages governing the agreement between nouns and pronouns and adjectives; in some languages it is quite arbitrary but in Indo-European languages it is usually based on sex or animateness', 'noun', 'In Spanish, every noun has a gender that affects the adjectives describing it.', 'Nghĩa trong ngữ cảnh: Giới tính.', 'School and education', 'B1', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], NULL),
