  ('vocab-import-db4baacb8d20becf1ec8c89b', 'orbit', 'ˈɔrbət', 'Ổ mắt.', 'the (usually elliptical) path described by one celestial body in its revolution about another', 'noun', 'he plotted the orbit of the moon', 'Nghĩa trong ngữ cảnh: Ổ mắt.', 'Nature and weather', 'C1', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], NULL),
