  ('vocab-import-eefc1767fec313f654053139', 'platinum', 'ˈplætənəm', 'Platin, bạch kim.', 'a heavy precious metallic element; grey-white and resistant to corroding; occurs in some nickel and copper ores and is also found native in some deposits', 'noun', 'The jeweler chose platinum for the ring because it resists tarnishing and corrosion.', 'Nghĩa trong ngữ cảnh: Platin, bạch kim.', 'Science', 'C1', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], NULL),
